{"id":"cyberpunk-dark","title":"Dark Tech — Cyberpunk Terminal","description":"Dark background, neon green and magenta, scanlines and a self-typing terminal. The aesthetic for AI tools, developer products and gaming communities.","tags":["cyberpunk","dark","terminal"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:28:05.410Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Dark Tech — Cyberpunk Terminal\ndescription: Dark background, neon green and magenta, scanlines and a self-typing terminal. The aesthetic for AI tools, developer products and gaming communities.\ntags: [cyberpunk, dark, terminal]\norder: 8\n---\n\n# Dark Tech — Cyberpunk Terminal\n\nHigh contrast neon on near-black: a CRT scanline overlay, blinking cursor, HUD corner brackets and a terminal that types itself.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#05050a` + faint grid lines |\n| Neon primary | `#00ff9c` green |\n| Neon secondary | `#ff2bd6` magenta |\n| Surface | `#0a0a12` panel, `#11111c` borders |\n| Type | Consolas / ui-monospace throughout |\n\n## Pieces\n\nStatus HUD strip → self-typing terminal window (scripted boot sequence) → three neon stat modules with hover glow → flicker + scanline ambience.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Dark Tech — Cyberpunk Terminal\n\nHigh contrast neon on near-black: a CRT scanline overlay, blinking cursor, HUD corner brackets and a terminal that types itself.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | `#05050a` + faint grid lines |\n| Neon primary | `#00ff9c` green |\n| Neon secondary | `#ff2bd6` magenta |\n| Surface | `#0a0a12` panel, `#11111c` borders |\n| Type | Consolas / ui-monospace throughout |\n\n## Pieces\n\nStatus HUD strip → self-typing terminal window (scripted boot sequence) → three neon stat modules with hover glow → flicker + scanline ambience.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>NEXUS//TERMINAL\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { background: #05050a; color: #c8ffd8; font-family: Consolas, ui-monospace, \"Cascadia Mono\", monospace; min-height: 100vh; padding: 34px 20px 60px; position: relative; overflow-x: hidden; }\n  body::before { content: \"\"; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0, 255, 156, 0.03) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px); pointer-events: none; z-index: 5; }\n  body::after { content: \"\"; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 255, 156, 0.04), transparent 30%); pointer-events: none; animation: flick 4s infinite; z-index: 6; }\n  @keyframes flick { 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.6; } 92% { opacity: 0.6; } 93% { opacity: 0.2; } 94% { opacity: 0.6; } 97% { opacity: 0.35; } }\n\n  .wrap { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 2; }\n  .hud { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #00ff9c; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #123; border-color: #0e3d29; padding: 10px 14px; margin-bottom: 22px; background: rgba(0, 255, 156, 0.03); }\n  .hud .m { color: #ff2bd6; }\n  .hud .blink { animation: blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite; }\n  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }\n\n  .term { border: 1px solid #0e3d29; background: rgba(5, 10, 8, 0.85); box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 156, 0.08), inset 0 0 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); }\n  .term-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #0e3d29; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #00ff9c; }\n  .term-head .dots { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-right: 8px; }\n  .term-head .dots i { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid #0e3d29; }\n  .term-head .dots i:first-child { background: #ff2bd6; }\n  .term-head .dots i:nth-child(2) { background: #00ff9c; }\n  .term-head .dots i:last-child { background: #ffd400; }\n  .term-body { padding: 18px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.75; min-height: 300px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }\n  .cursor { display: inline-block; width: 9px; height: 17px; background: #00ff9c; vertical-align: -3px; animation: blink 0.9s steps(1) infinite; }\n\n  .grid3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 22px; }\n  .mod { border: 1px solid #0e3d29; padding: 18px; background: rgba(0, 255, 156, 0.02); position: relative; transition: all 0.25s; }\n  .mod::before, .mod::after { content: \"\"; position: absolute; width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 2px solid #00ff9c; }\n  .mod::before { top: -2px; left: -2px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 0; }\n  .mod::after { bottom: -2px; right: -2px; border-left: 0; border-top: 0; }\n  .mod:hover { border-color: #00ff9c; box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0, 255, 156, 0.18); }\n  .mod .k { font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #5da886; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .mod .v { font-size: 27px; color: #00ff9c; margin: 8px 0 4px; text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(0, 255, 156, 0.5); }\n  .mod.mag .v { color: #ff2bd6; text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 43, 214, 0.5); }\n  .mod .s { font-size: 11.5px; color: #4c7a63; }\n\n  h1 { font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: #00ff9c; text-align: center; margin: 34px 0 6px; text-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(0, 255, 156, 0.55); }\n  .sub { text-align: center; font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.28em; color: #5da886; margin-bottom: 26px; }\n  .sub .m { color: #ff2bd6; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) { .grid3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"hud\">\n      \u003cspan>NEXUS_OS v2.77 \u003cspan class=\"blink\">▮\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\n      \u003cspan>UPLINK: \u003cb style=\"color:#00ff9c\">STABLE\u003c/b>\u003c/span>\n      \u003cspan class=\"m\">SECTOR-7 // NIGHT MODE\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003ch1>NEXUS//TERMINAL\u003c/h1>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"sub\">AI OPERATIONS CONSOLE — \u003cspan class=\"m\">AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"term\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"term-head\">\u003cspan class=\"dots\">\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003c/span> root@nexus: ~/ops\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"term-body\" id=\"term\">\u003cspan class=\"cursor\">\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"grid3\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"mod\">\u003cdiv class=\"k\">Neural load\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\" data-n=\"87.2\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s\">% of cluster capacity\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"mod mag\">\u003cdiv class=\"k\">Threats blocked\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\" data-n=\"1337\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s\">last 24 hours\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"mod\">\u003cdiv class=\"k\">Uptime\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\" data-n=\"99.99\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s\">% — 447 days streak\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // self-typing boot sequence\n    const el = document.getElementById('term');\n    const script = [\n      ['$ nexus boot --sector 7', 'g'],\n      ['[ok] neural core ......... ONLINE', 'dim'],\n      ['[ok] uplink to grid ...... STABLE', 'dim'],\n      ['[ok] threat lattice ...... ARMED', 'dim'],\n      ['', ''],\n      ['$ nexus run infiltrate --target vault_77', 'g'],\n      ['> bypassing ICE layer ....... done', 'dim'],\n      ['> spoofing signature ........ done', 'dim'],\n      ['> downloading payload ....... 4.2 TB', 'dim'],\n      ['', ''],\n      ['ACCESS GRANTED. welcome back, operator.', 'ok']\n    ];\n    const cls = { g: 'color:#00ff9c', dim: 'color:#5da886', ok: 'color:#ff2bd6;font-weight:bold' };\n    let li = 0, ci = 0;\n    const cursor = () => '\u003cspan class=\"cursor\">\u003c/span>';\n    function render(lines) { el.innerHTML = lines.map(l => l.t ? `\u003cspan style=\"${cls[l.c] || ''}\">${l.t}\u003c/span>` : '&nbsp;').join('\\n') + '\\n' + cursor(); }\n    const lines = [];\n    (function type() {\n      if (li >= script.length) { render(lines); return; }\n      const [text, c] = script[li];\n      ci++;\n      lines[li] = { t: text.slice(0, ci), c };\n      render(lines);\n      if (ci >= text.length) { li++; ci = 0; setTimeout(type, text ? 180 : 60); }\n      else setTimeout(type, text[ci - 1] === ' ' ? 12 : 34);\n    })();\n\n    // count-up modules\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-n]').forEach(el2 => {\n      const target = parseFloat(el2.dataset.n), dec = target % 1 ? 2 : 0;\n      let p = 0; const t0 = performance.now();\n      (function tick(t) {\n        p = Math.min((t - t0 - 3200) / 1600, 1); // start after typing\n        if (p > 0) el2.textContent = (target * (1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3))).toFixed(dec);\n        if (p \u003c 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n      })(performance.now());\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>NEXUS//TERMINAL\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: borde